   "text": "BPP University - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nBPP University\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nBPP University’s unique approach is education that is academically rigorous but also grounded in practical application that is highly relevant to our students, stakeholders and industry. In 2020, BPP University was granted indefinite taught degree awarding powers (TDAP) under the Office for Students (OfS) new regulatory framework. The award of indefinite TDAP, which will come into force on 1st September 2020 acknowledges the University’s academic integrity as a mature higher education institution with rigorous standards and academic governance. It has around 15,000 students, studying across 13 centers, in eight locations across England and online around the world. 70% are full-time, over 84% are on postgraduate programs.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n28/07/2026 08:22\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n07/04/2026 06:12\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £11,523.00\nMin: £9,986.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n12%\n1,800 of 15,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nOIEG (Oxford International Education Group)\nFounded Year\n1992\nCampus(es)\nLondon\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nAfghanistan, Bangladesh, Bhutan, Cameroon, India, Nepal, Pakistan, Sri Lanka, Sudan\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n01/04/2026\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation Available for International Students.\nScholarship Offered\nScholarships up to GPB 2000 for international Students.\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9eqfDaN12zY\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
